  });
  expect(AGGREGATED_TAG.readProse(body)).toBeUndefined();
  expect(DISPATCH_TAG.hasProse(body)).toBe(false);
  // the composed body's own context tag survives
  expect(body).toContain("<!-- atomaton:llm-context=include -->");
  expect(body).toContain("Delivered.");
});
```

Note `AGGREGATED_TAG.readProse(body)` — would `<!-- atomaton:llm-context=include -->` interfere? No.

Careful: the existing first test asserts `AGGREGATED_TAG.readProse(body)` undefined; keep.

